---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | instabid.live" description="Privacy Policy for instabid.live pay-to-rank leaderboard.">
  <article class="clay-box p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 my-4 sm:my-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500">Effective Date: August 22, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a bid or verify an Instagram account on instabid.live, we process public Instagram profile data (username handle, public profile picture, follower count, and public bio snippet). We process payment information securely via Stripe; instabid.live never touches or stores raw credit card details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">2. Analytics & Bot Protection Data</h2>
      <p>
        To prevent click fraud and artificial metric inflation, we log anonymized IP hashes and user-agent strings when links are clicked. We utilize privacy-friendly Google Analytics for website performance metrics.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">3. Zero Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        instabid.live contains no third-party ad networks, tracking cookies for ad targeting, or data monetization scripts. Your profile data is used strictly to display your leaderboard entry during active seasons.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">4. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        For data deletion or privacy inquiries, contact us at <code>privacy@instabid.live</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
